@* Three variants, stacked as upstream shows them: a plain line of note, a rule with a word
   sitting on it, and a line with a border under it. A marker is a full-width row in a stream of
   messages rather than a chip — that is what all three are for. *@
<div class="flex w-full max-w-sm flex-col gap-8">
    <Marker><MarkerContent>A default marker for inline notes.</MarkerContent></Marker>
    <Marker Variant="separator"><MarkerContent>A separator marker</MarkerContent></Marker>
    <Marker Variant="border"><MarkerContent>A border marker for row boundaries.</MarkerContent></Marker>
</div>
